Subject: [PATCH] Enable Now Nudge support

Force the SmartSuggestions Now Nudge rune to resolve as supported while
preserving the original method structure, registers, labels, and
try/catch flow.

---
 .../smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune.smali             | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune.smali b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune.smali
--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune.smali
@@ -5030,7 +5030,7 @@
 .method private static final SUPPORT_NOW_NUDGE_delegate$lambda$146()Z
     .locals 3

-    const/4 v0, 0x0
+    const/4 v0, 0x1

     :try_start_0
     sget-object v1, Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune;->INSTANCE:Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/featureconfig/rune/Rune;
